|---|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode | 29 of 55 (53%) | 138 | 2026-04-10 (`lib: annotate handlers`) |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 4 | 18 | 2017-10-04 |
| Alejandro Caravaca Puchades | 4 | 12 | not checked |
